  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment Help Guide\n\n### Filling out an SA800 Form\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 25 Mar, 2019 at 12:12 PM\n\n### The guide to fill a New SA 800 form is as follows:\nSA 800 Form page has two buttons on the left side one each for adding a new Page,and adding an Attachment. #\n\n### Also a PDF of the SA800 Form can be downloaded using the PDF Icon there on the Upper Right Corner of the Page.\n\n### \n\nAdd Page Button\nThis button has four options named as:\n\n - \n### Land and Property: It gives the details regarding a Property Income.    \n\n - \n### Foreign: Here details regarding Interest & Other Savings, Dividends and Disposals and Additional Information can be viewed and edited.    \n\n - \n### Chargeable Assets: It lets you add the description of an Asset which is disposed off with the relevant Amount.    \n\n - \n### Savings: It lets you add savings from interest, dividends, and other income.\n\n### \n\n### \n\nIt gives the details regarding a Property Income.\n\nSupplementary Pages:- Here details regarding Interest & Other Savings, Dividends and Disposals and Additional Information can be viewed and edited.\n\nChargeable Assets: It lets you add the description of an Asset which is disposed off with the relevant Amount.\n\nSavings:- It lets you add the Savings.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115347\">Self Assessment </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188542\">Self Assessment Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Filling out an SA800 Form\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 25 Mar, 2019 at 12:12 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<h4><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">The guide to fill a New SA 800 form is as follows:</span></strong><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">SA 800 Form page has two buttons on the left side one each for adding a new Page,and adding an Attachment. #</span></h4><h4><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Also a PDF of the SA800 Form can be downloaded using the PDF Icon there on the Upper Right Corner of the Page.<br><br></span></h4><h4><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><a name=\"_tnrromdszaw8\"></a></span></h4><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Add Page Button</strong><br>This button has four options named as:<br></span></p><ol><li><h4><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Land and Property:</strong> It gives the details regarding a Property Income.    </span></h4></li><li><h4><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Foreign: </strong>Here details regarding Interest &amp; Other Savings, Dividends and Disposals and Additional Information can be viewed and edited.    </span></h4></li><li><h4><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Chargeable Assets: </strong>It lets you add the description of an Asset which is disposed off with the relevant Amount.    </span></h4></li><li><h4><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Savings:</strong> It lets you add savings from interest, dividends, and other income.</span></h4></li></ol><h4><br></h4><h4><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074121874/original/T79vx3lnsqgLIWehdGii_6CGzA7lH-Hr_w.png?1553515700\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074121874/original/T79vx3lnsqgLIWehdGii_6CGzA7lH-Hr_w.png?1553515700\" data-fileid=\"9074121874\" data-uniquekey=\"1553515691691\" style=\"width: 949px;\"></span></h4><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">It gives the details regarding a <strong>Property Income.</strong></span></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074122014/original/SqVd0Kgr8jvWwJ8XUjHTQ_fF-PWBMvSvwA.png?1553515756\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074122014/original/SqVd0Kgr8jvWwJ8XUjHTQ_fF-PWBMvSvwA.png?1553515756\" data-fileid=\"9074122014\" data-uniquekey=\"1553515752987\" style=\"width: 916px;\"></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong><br></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Supplementary Pages:- </strong>Here details regarding Interest &amp; Other Savings, Dividends and Disposals and Additional Information can be viewed and edited.</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074122075/original/lEizUo8q4PhHpJ3NZRx2CZ92Gygi8nUAdA.png?1553515807\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074122075/original/lEizUo8q4PhHpJ3NZRx2CZ92Gygi8nUAdA.png?1553515807\" data-fileid=\"9074122075\" data-uniquekey=\"1553515752987\" style=\"width: 850px;\"></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Chargeable Assets: </strong>It lets you add the description of an Asset which is disposed off with the relevant Amount.</span></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074122159/original/CxFvWXW1uws_FiynxeHF_RPjeH1nj4N1gA.png?1553515861\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074122159/original/CxFvWXW1uws_FiynxeHF_RPjeH1nj4N1gA.png?1553515861\" data-fileid=\"9074122159\" data-uniquekey=\"1553515752987\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></strong></p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Savings:- </strong>It lets you add the Savings.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"> </span><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074122279/original/_aK9ajSKYEIZYvQkbAi6pFDaHpqxLccOjQ.png?1553515929\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074122279/original/_aK9ajSKYEIZYvQkbAi6pFDaHpqxLccOjQ.png?1553515929\" data-fileid=\"9074122279\" data-uniquekey=\"1553515752987\" style=\"width: 974px;\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p> </p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165530\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165530/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\